---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy at Rentoo — What we collect and what we don't"
  description="Rentoo's privacy policy. What we collect (name, phone, email), what we collect at verification (govt ID, employment proof) and when, how to ask us to delete your data."
>
  <SiteHeader slot="header" />

  <section class="privacy-hero">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="byline">
        <span class="byline-label">Legal</span>
        <span class="byline-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <span class="byline-meta">Updated May 2026</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Privacy at Rentoo.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        What we collect, what we don't, and how to ask us to delete it. Written
        in plain English by Rishabh, not by a law firm.
      </p>
      <div class="priv-meta">
        <span><strong>Effective:</strong> 1 May 2026</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span><strong>Applies to:</strong> rentoo.in and connect@rentoo.in</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span><strong>Questions:</strong> <a href="mailto:connect@rentoo.in">connect@rentoo.in</a></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy-prose">
    <div class="section-inner">

      <article class="priv-section">
        <span class="priv-num">01 — What we collect</span>
        <h2>The minimum we need to reply.</h2>
        <p>
          When you message us on WhatsApp, call, email, or use the contact form,
          we record your <strong>name, phone number, and email</strong> — whichever
          you give us. We also note the property IDs you ask about (like #01 or
          C-3) so we can pull up the file when we reply.
        </p>
        <p>
          That's it. We don't run forms with thirty fields. We don't try to guess
          your salary band. We don't ask you to upload anything to reach us.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="priv-section">
        <span class="priv-num">02 — Nothing required just to inquire</span>
        <h2>You don't hand over any ID to browse or message us.</h2>
        <p>To send an inquiry, all we need is your name and a phone number. While you're
        browsing listings or chatting with us on WhatsApp, we never ask for:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Income data, salary slips, or bank statements</li>
          <li>Social-media profiles or background-check reports</li>
          <li>Anything uploaded — no documents, no forms with thirty fields</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          <strong>The one exception is verification and the rental agreement.</strong>
          When a deal moves forward, we do require a <strong>government ID (Aadhaar, PAN,
          or passport)</strong> and <strong>employment ID / proof</strong> — for both
          tenant and owner verification and to draw up the lease. This is collected only
          at that stage, kept securely, used solely for the agreement, and never shared
          beyond the parties to it.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="priv-section">
        <span class="priv-num">03 — How we use what we collect</span>
        <h2>Reply to you. Send matching listings. That's it.</h2>
        <p>
          We use your contact info to <strong>reply to your inquiry</strong> and,
          if you've told us what you're looking for, to <strong>send matching
          properties on WhatsApp</strong> when they come in.
        </p>
        <p>
          We don't run drip campaigns. We don't sell newsletters. We don't have a
          CRM that messages you on your birthday. If something genuinely fits what
          you asked for, we'll send it — usually a single message, sometimes with
          a photo. You can tell us to stop any time and we will.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="priv-section">
        <span class="priv-num">04 — Cookies &amp; analytics</span>
        <h2>One analytics tool. No ad tracking.</h2>
        <p>
          We use <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> with IP anonymisation. It tells
          us roughly how many people visit, which listings get clicked, and which
          pages are slow. We don't use that data to follow you across the web.
        </p>
        <p>
          We don't install third-party advertising cookies. There's no Meta Pixel,
          no LinkedIn Insight tag, no retargeting. If you see a Rentoo ad somewhere
          (we run a handful), it's because of where it appears — not because of
          who you are.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="priv-section">
        <span class="priv-num">05 — Sharing</span>
        <h2>Your phone goes to the owner only after you agree to a visit.</h2>
        <p>
          The one place we ever share your information is with the <strong>owner
          of a specific property</strong>, and only after you've told us you'd like
          to visit. We share your name and phone so they can coordinate access. We
          tell you which owner before we do.
        </p>
        <p>
          We never sell your contact info. We don't share it with other brokers,
          property portals, or third-party marketers. There's no affiliate
          network. The list of people who get your phone is: us, and one owner per
          visit you've agreed to.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="priv-section">
        <span class="priv-num">06 — Your rights</span>
        <h2>Ask us to access, correct, or delete your data.</h2>
        <p>
          Write to <a href="mailto:connect@rentoo.in">connect@rentoo.in</a>
          and we'll <strong>respond within 7 days</strong>. You can ask us to:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Send you everything we have on file about you</li>
          <li>Correct anything that's wrong</li>
          <li>Delete your messages, name, and contact details</li>
          <li>Stop sending you matching listings (we'll confirm in writing)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We don't ask for a reason. We don't make you fill out a form. If the
          request is from the phone or email we already have on file, we'll
          process it on the same business day.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="priv-section">
        <span class="priv-num">07 — Data retention</span>
        <h2>Inquiries: 12 months. Signed leases: indefinite.</h2>
        <p>
          We keep <strong>inquiry messages and contact details for 12 months</strong>
          from your last interaction with us, then we delete them. If you asked
          about a property in June and haven't messaged since, we'll clear your
          file the following June.
        </p>
        <p>
          For tenants and owners who've actually signed a lease through us, we
          keep the <strong>signed agreement and basic transaction record
          indefinitely</strong>. That's required for tax filing, audits, and the
          rare landlord-tenant dispute that comes up years later.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="priv-section">
        <span class="priv-num">08 — Changes to this policy</span>
        <h2>We'll tell you if something meaningful changes.</h2>
        <p>
          If we ever add a new data category, a new third-party tool, or a new
          reason to share your data, we'll update this page and put a note in the
          date above. We won't bury a material change in legalese. If it matters,
          we'll write it plainly.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <SiteFooter slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .section-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-w);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--gutter);
  }

  /* ── Hero ── */
  .privacy-hero {
    background: var(--paper);
    padding-block: var(--space-3xl) var(--space-2xl);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .privacy-hero {
      padding-block: var(--space-4xl) var(--space-3xl);
    }
  }

  .privacy-hero .section-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .privacy-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5.5vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .privacy-hero .lede {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .byline {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .byline-sep {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .priv-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    background: var(--paper-warm);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .priv-meta strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .priv-meta a {
    color: var(--terracotta);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .priv-meta a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* ── Prose ── */
  .privacy-prose {
    padding-block: var(--space-3xl) var(--space-4xl);
  }

  .privacy-prose .section-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  /* ── Privacy sections ── */
  .priv-section {
    padding-block: var(--space-xl);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .priv-section:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .priv-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    display: block;
  }

  .priv-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .priv-section p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .priv-section p + p {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .priv-section p strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .priv-section a {
    color: var(--terracotta);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .priv-section a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .priv-section ul {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .priv-section ul li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .priv-section ul li::before {
    content: "·";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
